WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.433
Danny: Help!

2
00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:19.592
Tina: I’ve got you! Don’t let go!

3
00:00:19.593 --> 00:00:23.831
Brad: Trust me. I will hold on tight.

4
00:00:23.832 --> 00:00:25.339
Tina: All right, guys.

5
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:29.960
I’m going to pull you up.

6
00:00:29.961 --> 00:00:32.543
Brad: It’s not working.

7
00:00:32.544 --> 00:00:34.679
Tina: You’re too heavy.

8
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:37.294
Danny: Try again.

9
00:00:37.295 --> 00:00:42.341
Tina: I’m going to try something different.

10
00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.943
Brad: Are you sure this is safe?

11
00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:53.453
Danny: Just hang on tight, Brad.

12
00:00:53.454 --> 00:00:56.091
Brad: That was really scary.

13
00:00:56.092 --> 00:00:58.274
Tina: You’re okay now, Brad.

14
00:00:58.275 --> 00:01:01.870
Danny: Thanks, Tina. You saved us.

15
00:01:01.871 --> 00:01:07.388
Tina: Well, I told you we would make it to the top.

16
00:01:07.389 --> 00:01:12.398
Danny: Let’s keep going.

17
00:01:12.399 --> 00:01:14.951
Tina: This isn’t good.

18
00:01:14.952 --> 00:01:19.853
Brad: I don’t like this mountain.

19
00:01:19.854 --> 00:01:26.659
Danny: Watch out!

20
00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:31.765
Brad: Did I mention that I don’t like this mountain?

21
00:01:31.766 --> 00:01:34.306
Danny: It’s too big to climb over.

22
00:01:34.307 --> 00:01:37.252
Tina: What if you made a ladder out of the clay?

23
00:01:37.253 --> 00:01:39.937
Brad: Or you could make ropes.

24
00:01:39.938 --> 00:01:43.091
Danny: I don’t have enough magic clay for that.

25
00:01:43.092 --> 00:01:45.205
Tina: How much do you have left?

26
00:01:45.206 --> 00:01:51.674
Danny: Not much. I have a few tiny pieces of red clay [n3@and one lump of yellow clay.

27
00:01:51.675 --> 00:01:57.618
Danny: But I need to save it if we’re going to defeat Tristay.

28
00:01:57.619 --> 00:02:00.672
Tina: The red clay looks like little seeds.

29
00:02:00.673 --> 00:02:02.907
Brad: That gives me an idea.

30
00:02:02.908 --> 00:02:06.203
If you made some seeds, we could plant them.

31
00:02:06.204 --> 00:02:10.463
Brad: Then maybe a vine would grow to the top of the mountain.

32
00:02:10.464 --> 00:02:37.481
Danny: Good idea! We could climb up, just like in “Jack and the Beanstalk.”

33
00:02:37.482 --> 00:02:40.805
Tina: That’s so pretty!

34
00:02:40.806 --> 00:02:42.405
Brad: And it looks safe!

35
00:02:42.406 --> 00:02:50.617
We’ll have no problem now.

36
00:02:50.618 --> 00:02:53.961
Danny: Wow! We’re really high!

37
00:02:53.962 --> 00:03:02.575
Brad: We’re almost there.

38
00:03:02.576 --> 00:03:06.295
Danny: Quick, we’ve got to rescue Hopian and Bello.

39
00:03:06.296 --> 00:03:09.408
Tina: Keep an eye open for Tristay.

40
00:03:09.409 --> 00:03:14.239
Brad: And watch out for those evil creatures.

41
00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:20.124
Danny: It doesn’t look as if anyone is here.

42
00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:24.167
Brad: Look!

43
00:03:24.168 --> 00:03:26.093
Danny: Oh no!

44
00:03:26.094 --> 00:03:29.950
Tina: We’re too late!
